Z||000000||LivoniaFieroGT||04-16-2001||08:59 AM||||Interested in NOS application experience for the 2.8 in a Fiero.  Has anyone done it and how much benefit can I expect for the money?  I have a stock 2.8 with 30K and an automatic.  Had an 86 GT 5 speed and was plenty happy with it's zip.    Suggestions?||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||04-16-2001||02:46 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006347.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/006347.html</A> <P>chek out this thread i posted a little while ago.. i had a NOS kit and the NX kit is cheaper and better! you'll LOVE nitrous!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> and no matter what others say.. you REALLY have to do somthing dumb to kill your car on nitrous. i went through 16+ bottles in just over 6 months and NEVER had a nitrous related engine problem... Shaun41178 has an automatic with nitrous and he's please with it's performance. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2m6dyno.jpg" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/uploads/2m6dyno.jpg</A> <P>this was my street shot.. she made me PLENTY of $$$<P><BR>welcome to the forum... <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 04-16-2001).]||||reg||1
